    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0702" n="594" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg594"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.0084/46</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ras Tafari Makonnen, Prince Regent of Ethiopia, to
                        President Coolidge</hi><anchor n="10" xml:id="d649-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic">October 22,
                        1927</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received November 17.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Great and Good Friend</hi>: I have to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your friendly letter dated July 26th. 1927,<anchor n="11"
                        xml:id="d649-f2"/> for which I thank you.</p>
                <p>I sincerely regret to learn the delay of the re-establishment of an <pb
                        facs="0703" n="595" xml:id="pg595"/> official American representative in my
                    Capital; your Excellency may be sure that my desire was to see the
                    representative of the United States of America sometime this year, and I was
                    anxiously awaiting his arrival, when I may welcome him in due course.</p>
                <p>As your Excellency is already aware, that the question of an American Minister of
                    being sent to Addis-Ababa will be to strengthen the friendship which exists
                    between both the Government[s], I therefore expect undoubtedly that the Congress
                    will take successful [<hi rendition="#italic">favorable</hi>] action in this
                    matter as little [<hi rendition="#italic">soon</hi>] as possible and send up the
                    representative here.</p>
                <p>Your Good Friend</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>] [<signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Tafari Makonnen</hi></signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
